<!--
  Nicegram VR — the Russian source for the CLOUD LANGUAGE PACK.

  THIS FILE IS NOT COMPILED, AND IT MUST NOT BE COPIED INTO res/values-ru/.

  The package strips every Android locale — `localeFilters += ["zz"]`,
  TMessagesProj_AppQuest/build.gradle:124 — because Telegram serves its own language packs at
  runtime. A values-ru/ folder here is compiled, merged, and then dropped from the APK; it was
  tried, it shipped nothing, and it was deleted at fc887365 ("the localisation that never
  shipped"). The only channel that reaches a user is the pack, which answers by resource ENTRY
  NAME through LocaleController.

  So this file is an upload artifact, not a resource. Load these entry names into the Nicegram
  language pack; the English beside them stays in values/strings_vr.xml as the fallback.

  Parity with the English is checked by LanguagePackParityTest, which fails when a key is added
  on one side only or when the two disagree about their format placeholders.

  Voice: calm-expert, from the brand pack at
  nicegram-product-workspace/public/projects/nicegram-vr/design/docs/brand/strings.md —
  "шлем" not "хедсет", "панель" not "окно", "тишина" not "режим не беспокоить", an error names
  its cause and the next step, a button names the action rather than the object.
-->
